---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/ai.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Terafab - Hardware - Rycode"
  description="Planned semiconductor fab from SpaceX and Tesla. Phase 1 is $16.8B."
  variant="ai"
>
  <article class="ai-model">
    <p class="ai-model-kicker">Hardware · Chip fab</p>
    <h1 class="ai-model-title">Terafab</h1>
    <p class="ai-model-dek">A planned semiconductor fabrication plant. Spelling: Terafab (one word). SpaceX and Tesla. Phase 1 is $16.8B.</p>
    <hr class="ai-model-rule" />

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">What it is</h2>
    <p>Company text (SpaceX Updates Terafab; terafab.ai): a vertically integrated advanced semiconductor fab. Logic, memory, advanced packaging, and testing under one roof. Joint SpaceX and Tesla effort for the initial phase.</p>
    <p>Stated purpose: close the gap between global chip supply and future compute demand. Chips for Tesla Optimus and Cybercab-class edge inference, and high-power chips for SpaceX space-based data centers.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Where</h2>
    <p><strong>Full-scale site:</strong> Grimes County, Texas (near College Station / Houston). <strong>Precursor:</strong> Tesla research fab broken ground Apr 2026 on the North Campus of Giga Texas (Austin). Both from SpaceX Updates and SpaceX sites.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Capex</h2>
    <div class="ai-model-table-wrap">
      <table class="ai-model-table ai-model-table--prose">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Figure</th>
            <th scope="col">Label</th>
            <th scope="col">Source</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Phase 1 ~$16.8B; &gt;100 million sq ft planned; ≥3,000 jobs</td>
            <td>Public company figure, Aug 2026 announcement</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.spacex.com/updates/terafab">SpaceX Updates Terafab</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Phase ~$55B; full buildout up to ~$119B</td>
            <td>Earlier filing, May 2026 Grimes County public-hearing notice</td>
            <td>CNBC and The Register summarizing that notice</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>“1 terawatt of compute per year”</td>
            <td>Company figure</td>
            <td><a href="https://terafab.ai/">terafab.ai</a></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Peer fab</h2>
    <p>TSMC Arizona (company): investment path $12B to $265B planned; 10 fabs, 2 advanced packaging, R&amp;D; campus over 1,100 acres; Fab1 N4 HVM since Q4 2024. A US leading-edge foundry buildout. Merchant foundry, beside a SpaceX and Tesla plant.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Sources</h2>
    <ul class="ai-model-sources">
      <li><a href="https://www.spacex.com/updates/terafab">SpaceX Updates, Terafab</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.spacex.com/sites">SpaceX sites</a> (Grimes County)</li>
      <li><a href="https://terafab.ai/">terafab.ai</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.tsmc.com/static/abouttsmcaz/index.htm">TSMC Arizona</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/05/06/elon-musks-spacex-chip-fab-in-texas-to-cost-up-to-119-billion.html">CNBC, 6 May 2026</a>, earlier filing figures</li>
      <li><a href="/ai/hardware/data-centers/memphis-colossus/">Memphis / Colossus</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>
